No upstream instructions were executed. This artifact uses Synapse's postMessage host for persistence and exports; it does not use a public export or storage server. External media requested by a user-imported diagram may still be fetched to render or embed that media.

Rebuild from the verified extraction (the existing retained viewer is reused offline):
node scripts/vendor-drawio.mjs --source <drawio/src/main/webapp> --manifest <package-manifest.json>
For a fresh destination, also supply --viewer <official viewer-static.min.js> from the exact pinned commit above. Its expected checksum is enforced.
Verify the published copy:
node scripts/vendor-drawio.mjs --check
